%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: BleakFallsEnd
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125570
    - rid: 9079475045585125571
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We've all crammed ourselves on two of the tables, eating our supper.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We might be down 70 septims, but the dragon had like 150 on him, so it's
      okay to spend a little.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125572
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm not entirely sure where dragons get their coin from...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: From people they eat, maybe?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: You know, I can't imagine it to be a fulfilling meal experience to eat
      live people.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Especially since they've still got their clothes on-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125573
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm? What's up, Yuri?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, since we have some time to relax...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125574
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I thought... m-maybe we could...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125575
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Please don't look at me like that. We're all still in the same room,
      and I don't want to cause a scene!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Talk more about this world?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125576
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh... that's not exactly where I thought this was going.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Actually, you know what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure, is there something specific you want to know about?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, do you remember when you first laid out the cosmological structure
      of this place?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125577
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: When we first met at Dragonsreach? Yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, you also mentioned that my magic conjures things from Oblivion,
      which was an outer plane, if I remember correctly?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right. Is there something you want to know about Oblivion?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, what is it like?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I'm going to be here for a while, aren't I?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125578
    - rid: 9079475045585125579
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: -now, the Sigil Stones were what anchored the Oblivion Gates to Mundus-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125580
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright you two, you need to go to bed.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125581
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125582
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: The sun fully set, like, a few hours ago and the inn-keeper finally started
      complaining about you two.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125583
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: It's just...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: It's been so nice to experience such a lovingly-crafted world from your
      knowledge.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125584
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Heh. You're welcome, Yuri.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us get up from our seats, so that we can head to our rooms
      for the night.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125585
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Satisfied that she got us moving, Natsuki heads into her room, which
      she's sharing with Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125586
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, {mc}?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: If we ever make it back home-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: When we get back home; what you're saying is quitter-talk.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125587
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: When we get back home, could I play these games with you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125588
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You mean the Elder Scrolls games?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, the only multiplayer game is an MMO-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which does have a boat-load of lore, mind you, but-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not really interested in that one.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So you wouldn't really be able to play with me in that sense.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: That's fine, I thought maybe we could...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125589
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Take turns?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125590
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'Part of me really wants to let her down hard by saying something like:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: '"That sounds really boring, dingus!"'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... but I'm pretty sure that would cause major emotional damage.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... maybe. We'll see.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Depends on whether or not any major changes happen to Earth in our absence.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Which, now that I think about it, could be entirely possible...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I make my way to my room for the night, letting Yuri stew on whatever
      it is she stews on.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125591
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125592
    - rid: 9079475045585125593
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... that bed's lookin' <i>real</i> comfy right about now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I take off my armor, setting it up in the dresser and plop myself on
      the bed.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: While not as comfy as my own bed, it's certain better than sleeping on
      a couch or cot.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I close my eyes, focusing on the crackling sound of the fire in the hall,
      letting it slowly guide me to sleep...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125594
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Psst! Hey!)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Is {mc} asleep yet?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125595
    - rid: 9079475045585125596
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125597
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125598
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, I just wanted to talk to <b>you</b>...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125599
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I've really loved being able to hear-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125600
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (No, hear isn't the right word for it, since <b>you</b> don't make any
      noise when <b>you</b> talk.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125601
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Whatever the best way to describe it is, I like <b>your</b> presence.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125602
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Gosh, I feel like a young girl in love...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125603
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Because that's what I am, ahaha~!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125604
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ahh...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125605
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So, I've been talking a lot about me.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125606
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Now that I think about it, I do that a lot.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125607
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I've only ever asked <b>you</b> practical questions, haven't I...?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, anyway, how's life on that end of the monitor?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125608
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm assuming monitor.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125609
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125610
    - rid: 9079475045585125611
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125612
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125616
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125617
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uh... that's kind of all I had...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125618
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uh...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125619
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh, I know!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125620
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So, uh, <b>you</b> remember when that <i>thing</i> was trying to get
      in-between us?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125621
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (It mentioned something about Sayori getting my epiphany after... something.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do you have any idea what it was talking about?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125622
    - rid: 9079475045585125624
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
